---
import PageShell from '../components/PageShell.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | AITokenCalculator';
const description =
  'AITokenCalculator privacy policy: we collect no personal data. Everything runs in your browser, preferences stay on your device, and no text is ever uploaded.';

const published = '2026-08-21T00:00:00Z';
const updated = 'August 21, 2026';
---

<PageShell
  title={title}
  description={description}
  path="/privacy-policy/"
  publishedTime={published}
  modifiedTime={published}
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lead="Short version: AITokenCalculator collects nothing personal. Your text stays in your browser."
  updatedLabel={`Last updated ${updated}`}
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h2>1 · What we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Nothing personal.</strong> There are no accounts, no signups and no server-side processing of your inputs.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Text you paste or files you upload</strong> are processed entirely in your browser using JavaScript. They are never transmitted to us, never stored, never logged.</li>
      <li><strong>Calculator settings</strong> (theme, currency) are saved in your browser's localStorage so the tool remembers them. This data stays on your device and you can clear it anytime via browser settings.</li>
      <li><strong>No cookies</strong> are used for tracking. No advertising identifiers. No analytics profiles.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2 · Third-party services</h2>
    <p>
      The site is static — fonts and charts are self-hosted, so no third party sees your visits
      through this tool. If hosting-layer infrastructure logs standard request data (such as your
      IP address for security and rate-limiting), that is handled by the hosting provider under
      its own policy and is not used by us for profiling.
    </p>

    <h2>3 · Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Because no personal data is collected, stored or shared, there is nothing to export,
      correct or delete on our side. Under GDPR, CCPA and similar regulations you retain all
      standard rights; since we hold no data about you, exercising them requires nothing further.
    </p>

    <h2>4 · Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The service is a developer utility not directed at children under 13, and we collect no
      information from any visitor of any age.
    </p>

    <h2>5 · Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes, the updated date at the top will change with it. Material changes
      will be highlighted on the homepage for a reasonable period.
    </p>

    <h2>6 · Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about privacy? Reach us at <a href="mailto:salarypitcher@gmail.com">salarypitcher@gmail.com</a>
      or via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
